WEBVTT

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:59.490
Greetings, my good friends. You all undoubtedly have been under the delusion, or shall I say misapprehension, that we of the cartoon animal kingdom are lacking in the finer sensibilities. Now to disprove this.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:03.850
We shall ask you to forget our form of pranks and playfulness.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:08.000
We ask you in the name of dignity and art

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.480
to put yourselves in a receptive frame of mind

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:15.240
and not to expect of us the foolery

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:18.350
and clowning you generally associate us with.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:21.680
And now, to an all-musical program.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.400
Thank you.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:32.490
Thank you.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:29.980
Thank you.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:51.230
Alas, alas, the best laid plans of mice and men often go astray.
